s on form. **Much as** we admire fiery speech, **however passionate** the speaker, a reply that **concedes** a small point **earns** credibility. **Albeit** brief, a polite formula such as “**I must stop you there**” keeps order.","Careful speakers also **adapt register**: what **reads well** at a podium may **sound stiff** online. And when a committee **does away with** a procedure, citizens should ask who **will do without** a voice. **Be that as it may**, public life **runs on** patience."],"kicker":"REPORT","by":"Civic Language Lab","gloss":[["fiery","inflamado"],["concede","conceder"],["stiff","rígido"],["run on","funcionar à base de"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"A reply that concedes a small point loses credibility.","ans":"F","why":"earns credibility."},{"q":"A polite formula can keep order.","ans":"T","why":"I must stop you there."},{"q":"Online text should copy podium style exactly.","ans":"F","why":"may sound stiff online."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“do away with” = ?","opts":["abolir","fazer longe","vencer"],"ans":0,"why":"do away with."},{"q":"“albeit” = ?","opts":["embora, ainda que","além disso","portanto"],"ans":0,"why":"albeit."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verifique","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**Concessões**: albeit, much as, however + adj","**Albeit** brief; **Much as** we admire…"],["**Do**: do away with, do without, do justice to","They **did away with** the fee"],["**Registro**: formal ↔ informal","**It is incumbent upon us** → **We’ve got to**"],["**Gêneros**: elogio, réplica, notícia, carta, aviso","steps, rebuttal, report"],["**Moderar e interpretar**","cut off politely; compress, never distort"]],"cap":"Lista de verificação da Unidade 5 (C2)"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"